→ ndv-diagnose (root cause) · `src/age.js:3`: guard `n < 0 || n > 150` is false for `NaN`, so any non-numeric input (`null`, `undefined`, `"abc"`, `{}`, booleans, `"NaN"`, `"Infinity"`, empty/whitespace strings) silently returns `NaN` instead of throwing `RangeError`, contradicting the stated contract.
